    <mxCell id="legend_title" value="Legend &amp; Invariants" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="49" y="971" width="1902" height="22" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="legend_text" value="1. A crop alert moves the plot to precision mode; closed or closed_without_fumigation return it to area mode (ADR-002).&lt;br/&gt;2. Only a Federation agronomist with fresh MFA authorizes an order; the authorizer is never the pilot; no trigger authorizes.&lt;br/&gt;3. An order closes only after the verification result; objects without a grant are quarantined.&lt;br/&gt;4. Solid = normal progression; dashed red = timeout, rejection or revocation; dashed green = direct or late recovery; thick border = terminal." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="49" y="993" width="1902" height="86" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
